This product is independent research software for Indian-market paper trading.
It is not a vendored copy of any third-party trading system.

---------------------------------------------------------------------------
Inspiration (not source)
---------------------------------------------------------------------------

Grow's `tradingagents/` package is a clean-room foundation inspired by the
public architecture of:

    TradingAgents: Multi-Agents LLM Financial Trading Framework
    https://github.com/TauricResearch/TradingAgents
    Licensed under the Apache License, Version 2.0

No source files from that repository are copied into this tree. Agent role
names (analyst, researcher, trader, risk) and the idea of a research graph
are used as architectural vocabulary only. Full LangGraph integration with
upstream TradingAgents is explicitly deferred.

---------------------------------------------------------------------------
What Grow does not claim
---------------------------------------------------------------------------

Grow is not a broker, not a SEBI-registered advisor, and not a live trading
system. Milestone 1 cannot place orders at any real venue.
